Really?

584
00:26:35,350 --> 00:26:36,350
Really.

585
00:26:36,440 --> 00:26:37,440
Are you sure?

586
00:26:38,240 --> 00:26:39,240
Sure.

587
00:26:39,960 --> 00:26:41,140
Wonderful.

588
00:26:42,550 --> 00:26:43,550
Mentor.

589
00:26:43,920 --> 00:26:45,460
I won't be if you keep hitting me.

590
00:26:45,550 --> 00:26:46,460
I'm telling you,

591
00:26:46,550 --> 00:26:47,936
even if it's a small matter,

592
00:26:47,960 --> 00:26:49,180
it'd still be worth it.

593
00:26:49,270 --> 00:26:51,420
A great blessing for our division.

594
00:26:52,590 --> 00:26:54,090
We won big today.

595
00:26:55,310 --> 00:26:56,616
All past Grand lords.

596
00:26:56,640 --> 00:26:57,976
Our division is so blessed.

597
00:26:58,000 --> 00:26:59,530
Not composed at all.

598
00:27:00,160 --> 00:27:01,490
Well said.

599
00:27:01,720 --> 00:27:02,720
Jiu Jiu,

600
00:27:02,790 --> 00:27:03,896
as for these two disciples,

601
00:27:03,920 --> 00:27:05,980
let's not move them to Griefbane.

602
00:27:06,030 --> 00:27:06,896
We won't?

603
00:27:06,920 --> 00:27:07,456
Right.

604
00:27:07,480 --> 00:27:09,330
Staying at Jade Division is fine.

605
00:27:10,400 --> 00:27:12,140
But Changshou's liquor is so good.

606
00:27:12,240 --> 00:27:13,900
Then you'll buy my liquor for me.

607
00:27:14,350 --> 00:27:15,526
No stopping me.

608
00:27:15,550 --> 00:27:18,006
So the Seizing and Human Sects

609
00:27:18,030 --> 00:27:20,050
are all worthless.

610
00:27:20,550 --> 00:27:22,380
And Ascendance Sect disciples

611
00:27:22,750 --> 00:27:24,860
actually obsess over money.

612
00:27:25,350 --> 00:27:27,460
What a waste of cultivation.

613
00:27:29,440 --> 00:27:30,440
I'll protect you.

614
00:27:32,750 --> 00:27:33,750
Hey, kid.

615
00:27:34,000 --> 00:27:35,440
You are indeed an immortal seedling.

616
00:27:42,240 --> 00:27:43,240
Stop pretending.

617
00:27:43,350 --> 00:27:44,350
You are.

618
00:27:45,070 --> 00:27:46,416
Changgeng.

619
00:27:46,440 --> 00:27:47,086
Changgeng?

620
00:27:47,110 --> 00:27:47,770
Changgeng?

621
00:27:48,110 --> 00:27:48,896
Who is Changgeng?

622
00:27:48,920 --> 00:27:50,616
A Jade disciple as Changgeng?

623
00:27:50,640 --> 00:27:52,086
Elucidating Sect plays it well,

624
00:27:52,110 --> 00:27:53,656
but they're blind.

625
00:27:53,680 --> 00:27:55,176
What are you laughing at?

626
00:27:55,200 --> 00:27:56,330
No offense.

627
00:27:56,830 --> 00:27:57,830
Jade Division

628
00:27:58,270 --> 00:28:00,810
is Ascendance's weakest branch.

629
00:28:04,240 --> 00:28:05,440
Please don't take it to heart.

630
00:28:05,680 --> 00:28:07,050
I'm only speaking the truth.

631
00:28:07,440 --> 00:28:08,440
Not at all.

632
00:28:10,920 --> 00:28:13,530
You're saying Changgeng is from there?

633
00:28:13,880 --> 00:28:14,880
I'm sorry.

634
00:28:15,070 --> 00:28:16,730
That is simply impossible.

635
00:28:17,270 --> 00:28:18,810
You all saw it yourself.

636
00:28:18,920 --> 00:28:21,140
That kid used a basic formation

637
00:28:21,440 --> 00:28:22,980
to such an extent.

638
00:28:23,240 --> 00:28:24,620
Remarkable skills.

639
00:28:26,240 --> 00:28:29,460
I didn't make it alone.

640
00:28:29,550 --> 00:28:31,490
Aunt Jiu Jiu helped the most.

641
00:28:31,960 --> 00:28:32,960
That's her.

642
00:28:34,440 --> 00:28:35,440
Me?

643
00:28:37,750 --> 00:28:39,330
I'm exhausted.

644
00:28:39,790 --> 00:28:40,810
Aunt Jiu Jiu rules.

645
00:28:41,350 --> 00:28:43,010
Only 0.03% completed.

646
00:28:44,160 --> 00:28:46,090
It's nothing. Not worth mentioning.

647
00:28:46,440 --> 00:28:47,010
That's enough.

648
00:28:47,240 --> 00:28:48,240
Right. Keep it low key.

649
00:28:49,400 --> 00:28:52,050
Since a senior helped,

650
00:28:52,750 --> 00:28:54,086
making this formation

651
00:28:54,110 --> 00:28:55,660
makes perfect sense.

652
00:28:58,590 --> 00:28:59,590
Hey,

653
00:29:00,590 --> 00:29:01,750
are you really not Changgeng?

654
00:29:02,270 --> 00:29:02,900
Changgeng?

655
00:29:03,200 --> 00:29:03,726
Who's that?

656
00:29:03,750 --> 00:29:04,286
Who's that?

657
00:29:04,310 --> 00:29:04,766
Who's that?

658
00:29:04,790 --> 00:29:05,216
Who's that?

659
00:29:05,240 --> 00:29:05,810
Who's that?

660
00:29:06,160 --> 00:29:07,160
Cultivator.

661
00:29:07,830 --> 00:29:08,940
It's a misunderstanding.

662
00:29:09,790 --> 00:29:12,700
Changgeng isn't in Ascendance Sect.

663
00:29:13,830 --> 00:29:14,830
I don't buy it.

664
00:29:15,200 --> 00:29:16,200
Here's more.

665
00:29:18,750 --> 00:29:20,180
The Realm Scroll?

666
00:29:20,350 --> 00:29:21,350
That's right.

667
00:29:21,750 --> 00:29:23,616
This is an Innate Treasure.

668
00:29:23,640 --> 00:29:25,530
The Realm Scroll.

669
00:29:27,110 --> 00:29:28,290
A replica.

670
00:29:29,750 --> 00:29:30,750
A replica?

671
00:29:31,110 --> 00:29:31,696
What?

672
00:29:31,720 --> 00:29:33,616
I painted this myself.

673
00:29:33,640 --> 00:29:34,640
The Mini.

674
00:29:34,960 --> 00:29:36,660
Realm Scroll.

675
00:29:37,550 --> 00:29:38,620
You painted this?

676
00:29:39,070 --> 00:29:40,070
Then look all you want.

677
00:29:40,640 --> 00:29:41,840
You, who set up the formation.

678
00:29:42,550 --> 00:29:43,670
With this formation of mine,

679
00:29:43,920 --> 00:29:44,976
do you dare to try it?

680
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:45,460
No.

681
00:29:45,510 --> 00:29:46,726
What's there to fear?

682
00:29:46,750 --> 00:29:47,326
Do you know how to...

683
00:29:47,350 --> 00:29:47,770
No.

684
00:29:47,960 --> 00:29:49,486
My formation is easy. Just try it.

685
00:29:49,510 --> 00:29:50,510
I don't want to.

686
00:29:57,750 --> 00:29:58,940
Senior Changshou,

687
00:29:59,350 --> 00:30:01,570
to keep peace between sects,

688
00:30:02,070 --> 00:30:03,090
you endure humiliation.

689
00:30:04,400 --> 00:30:05,530
Such fortitude.

690
00:30:06,240 --> 00:30:08,220
When will I ever match that?

691
00:30:16,160 --> 00:30:18,530
This disciple is weak,

692
00:30:19,160 --> 00:30:21,050
but unyieldingly so.

693
00:30:25,030 --> 00:30:25,810
Go.

694
00:30:25,960 --> 00:30:27,490
Why not?

695
00:30:34,550 --> 00:30:35,376
Kuai Si is the one

696
00:30:35,400 --> 00:30:37,290
with the Three-Dot Mark.

697
00:30:37,880 --> 00:30:39,220
Why not eliminate him?

698
00:30:39,920 --> 00:30:41,376
He's an Elder of Ascendance Sect.

699
00:30:41,400 --> 00:30:43,090
Killing him brings heavy karma.

700
00:30:43,160 --> 00:30:44,460
Have you thought about that?

701
00:30:46,030 --> 00:30:47,030
Everyone.

702
00:30:47,720 --> 00:30:51,330
Having the Three Sects here is rare.

703
00:30:51,640 --> 00:30:54,936
Since Chan Sect seeks a bout,

704
00:30:54,960 --> 00:30:56,486
why not take this chance

705
00:30:56,510 --> 00:30:58,730
to hold a Grand Assembly?

706
00:30:58,880 --> 00:31:00,530
Tomorrow at noon,

707
00:31:00,720 --> 00:31:02,326
we'll ask Cloudlink Hermit

708
00:31:02,350 --> 00:31:04,806
to set up the Mini Realm Scroll.

709
00:31:04,830 --> 00:31:08,730
Anyone who wishes can challenge it.

710
00:31:08,790 --> 00:31:12,530
Consider it a friendly exchange.

711
00:31:13,160 --> 00:31:14,160
What do you say?

712
00:31:16,200 --> 00:31:17,200
Sure.

713
00:31:17,550 --> 00:31:19,090
Tomorrow at noon then.

714
00:31:19,270 --> 00:31:21,700
I'll offer our sacred pearl as a prize.

715
00:31:22,400 --> 00:31:23,660
Come and claim it.

716
00:31:33,180 --> 00:31:36,180
[Hall of Virtue]

717
00:31:41,310 --> 00:31:44,770
So it was you spreading rumors about Changgeng

718
00:31:45,750 --> 00:31:48,220
and luring people to Ascendance Sect?

719
00:31:50,680 --> 00:31:53,220
Elder, are you blaming us?

720
00:31:55,480 --> 00:31:57,330
Hypocrites.

721
00:31:58,110 --> 00:31:59,220
You fiend.

722
00:32:02,160 --> 00:32:03,700
What is your purpose

723
00:32:04,350 --> 00:32:06,090
in coming to Ascendance Sect?

724
00:32:08,790 --> 00:32:10,530
What purpose could we have?

725
00:32:11,000 --> 00:32:13,810
Once you take the grand seat,

726
00:32:13,960 --> 00:32:14,856
the entire Ascendance Sect

727
00:32:14,880 --> 00:32:16,860
will be Westdawn Sect's ally.

728
00:32:17,880 --> 00:32:19,290
Elder Kuai Si

729
00:32:19,880 --> 00:32:21,730
is a crucial figure for us.

730
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:26,460
Glad you know it.

731
00:32:30,720 --> 00:32:33,570
Aren't you afraid Changgeng is here?

732
00:32:33,880 --> 00:32:37,010
He survived the Divine-Demon Tribulation.

733
00:32:40,720 --> 00:32:43,180
I am already an Aureate Immortal.

734
00:32:43,510 --> 00:32:45,136
In the entire Ascendance Sect,

735
00:32:45,160 --> 00:32:45,856
except for Detached Master,

736
00:32:45,880 --> 00:32:47,380
no one is a match for me.

737
00:32:48,070 --> 00:32:50,330
A coward hiding in the shadows

738
00:32:50,480 --> 00:32:52,656
doesn't even have the courage

739
00:32:52,680 --> 00:32:53,680
to face me.

740
00:32:53,960 --> 00:32:55,250
Why should I fear him?

741
00:32:55,440 --> 00:32:56,440
What if

742
00:32:56,920 --> 00:32:58,660
he is hiding on purpose?

743
00:33:00,160 --> 00:33:01,160
Perhaps

744
00:33:01,270 --> 00:33:03,770
he is Detached Master's secret card,

745
00:33:04,680 --> 00:33:06,250
waiting for you to drop your guard

746
00:33:07,440 --> 00:33:09,460
to deal a fatal blow.

747
00:33:15,030 --> 00:33:17,250
Our plan to take over Ascendance Sect

748
00:33:17,830 --> 00:33:19,420
must go perfectly.

749
00:33:20,110 --> 00:33:21,980
You have sacrificed too much for this.

750
00:33:22,030 --> 00:33:23,050
If we fail,

751
00:33:23,110 --> 00:33:24,660
not only is it all for nothing,

752
00:33:25,440 --> 00:33:27,046
but you'll be charged with murder

753
00:33:27,070 --> 00:33:28,660
and betraying your own sect.

754
00:33:32,310 --> 00:33:34,696
I will never fail.

755
00:33:34,720 --> 00:33:35,940
If you don't want to fail,

756
00:33:36,240 --> 00:33:38,090
eliminate the threats early

757
00:33:38,640 --> 00:33:40,220
to ensure success.

758
00:33:47,880 --> 00:33:48,880
By the way,

759
00:33:49,480 --> 00:33:51,420
Changgeng has something

760
00:33:53,070 --> 00:33:54,330
that I want.

761
00:34:11,420 --> 00:34:13,046
[Seven days ago, Turtle Island]

762
00:34:13,070 --> 00:34:14,090
What happened to me?

763
00:34:15,590 --> 00:34:17,490
My Dragon Mark is gone?

764
00:34:25,190 --> 00:34:26,190
An illusion?

765
00:34:26,480 --> 00:34:27,560
Why can't I smell anything?

766
00:34:27,800 --> 00:34:28,340
An illusion.

767
00:34:28,710 --> 00:34:29,780
Transform into a dragon.

768
00:34:30,880 --> 00:34:31,980
Transform into a dragon.

769
00:34:43,030 --> 00:34:44,030
Who let you in?

770
00:34:44,590 --> 00:34:46,336
Duh. This is Turtle Island.

771
00:34:46,360 --> 00:34:47,650
I go wherever I want.

772
00:34:48,550 --> 00:34:49,550
Come out.

773
00:34:56,590 --> 00:34:57,610
Young lady,

774
00:34:58,000 --> 00:34:59,566
why are you so rude?

775
00:34:59,590 --> 00:35:01,046
I speak however I want.

776
00:35:01,070 --> 00:35:02,590
Didn't your parents teach you manners?

777
00:35:02,630 --> 00:35:03,900
I have no parents.

778
00:35:05,000 --> 00:35:06,086
No wonder you're so unruly.

779
00:35:06,110 --> 00:35:07,110
What did you say?

780
00:35:07,510 --> 00:35:08,690
Say that again.

781
00:35:12,280 --> 00:35:13,856
Once my power is restored,

782
00:35:13,880 --> 00:35:14,980
your little skills

783
00:35:15,150 --> 00:35:16,340
won't mean a thing to me.

784
00:35:16,480 --> 00:35:18,170
Fine. You're asking for it.

785
00:35:19,630 --> 00:35:20,630
Don't hit him.

786
00:35:21,030 --> 00:35:22,050
Why not?

787
00:35:22,150 --> 00:35:23,150
He is...

788
00:35:23,230 --> 00:35:24,230
What?

789
00:35:24,880 --> 00:35:26,340
He's a pitiful guy.

790
00:35:28,150 --> 00:35:29,940
Isn't everyone pitiful?

791
00:35:30,280 --> 00:35:31,340
Am I not pitiful?

792
00:35:31,510 --> 00:35:33,940
My family was killed by the Dragon Clan.

793
00:35:34,320 --> 00:35:35,490
Did I ever try to end it?

794
00:35:36,920 --> 00:35:37,460
You...

795
00:35:37,880 --> 00:35:39,090
Your family... by dragons?

796
00:35:39,280 --> 00:35:41,646
Yes. Dragon Calamity brought floods.

797
00:35:41,670 --> 00:35:42,870
The whole village was drowned.

798
00:35:43,070 --> 00:35:44,570
Only I survived.

799
00:35:47,960 --> 00:35:49,490
When I'm strong enough,

800
00:35:49,880 --> 00:35:52,130
I'll make the Dragon Clan pay in blood.

801
00:36:00,230 --> 00:36:01,230
I'm sorry.

802
00:36:01,840 --> 00:36:02,840
I didn't know.

803
00:36:06,920 --> 00:36:08,690
You said you can't smell anything?

804
00:36:08,920 --> 00:36:10,170
Take one bowl of this daily.

805
00:36:10,400 --> 00:36:11,400
It might help.

806
00:36:12,920 --> 00:36:14,686
There are many pitiful people.

807
00:36:14,710 --> 00:36:16,256
If everyone were like you,

808
00:36:16,280 --> 00:36:17,900
hiding and self-pitying,

809
00:36:18,230 --> 00:36:19,510
the world outside would be gone.

810
00:36:20,190 --> 00:36:22,260
The key is to stand on your own.

811
00:36:22,480 --> 00:36:23,900
Only by making yourself stronger,

812
00:36:24,230 --> 00:36:25,650
can you stop being pitiful.

813
00:36:26,480 --> 00:36:27,480
Understand?

814
00:36:28,670 --> 00:36:29,670
I understand.

815
00:36:30,630 --> 00:36:32,050
Careful, it's hot.

816
00:36:32,630 --> 00:36:33,630
Mentor.

817
00:36:33,800 --> 00:36:34,920
Your disciple pays respects.

818
00:36:38,110 --> 00:36:39,110
Please rise.

819
00:36:39,800 --> 00:36:40,940
Who are you bowing to?

820
00:36:41,150 --> 00:36:42,456
Senior is right.

821
00:36:42,480 --> 00:36:43,416
Only when I become stronger,

822
00:36:43,440 --> 00:36:44,650
I won't be pitiful.

823
00:36:44,840 --> 00:36:46,166
Please accept me as your disciple, Mentor.

824
00:36:46,190 --> 00:36:47,380
That's not what I meant.

825
00:36:47,920 --> 00:36:48,920
This is inappropriate.

826
00:36:49,000 --> 00:36:50,460
You have a noble status.

827
00:36:50,760 --> 00:36:52,530
How do you know his status?

828
00:36:53,630 --> 00:36:54,630
I...

829
00:36:55,070 --> 00:36:56,130
I just guessed.

830
00:36:56,320 --> 00:36:57,296
I don't deserve this.

831
00:36:57,320 --> 00:36:58,780
How can I be your Mentor?

832
00:36:59,070 --> 00:37:01,460
You won't take me as a disciple?

833
00:37:13,070 --> 00:37:15,046
I think you should accept him.

834
00:37:15,070 --> 00:37:17,420
A spoiled young master like him,

835
00:37:17,670 --> 00:37:18,740
if left out in the world,

836
00:37:19,230 --> 00:37:20,650
wouldn't survive three days.

837
00:37:23,630 --> 00:37:25,090
I have an idea.

838
00:37:29,000 --> 00:37:32,050
I can accept you on my Mentor's behalf.

839
00:37:32,840 --> 00:37:35,046
We will be fellow disciples.

840
00:37:35,070 --> 00:37:36,210
What do you say?

841
00:37:38,760 --> 00:37:39,760
Mentor accepts you.

842
00:37:41,840 --> 00:37:42,690
Greetings, Senior.

843
00:37:42,840 --> 00:37:43,980
Good, Junior.

844
00:37:45,480 --> 00:37:46,816
Our Mentor is journeying the realms,

845
00:37:46,840 --> 00:37:48,256
so I will teach you

846
00:37:48,280 --> 00:37:50,010
and guide you on the path.

847
00:37:50,480 --> 00:37:51,296
From this day on,

848
00:37:51,320 --> 00:37:53,170
you are a Seizing Sect disciple.

849
00:37:53,880 --> 00:37:54,880
Hanzhi,

850
00:37:55,070 --> 00:37:56,530
greet your Uncle.

851
00:37:57,880 --> 00:37:58,646
It's fine.

852
00:37:58,670 --> 00:38:00,460
We'll just use our own terms.

853
00:38:01,110 --> 00:38:02,980
I'll call you Senior, you call me Uncle.

854
00:38:03,920 --> 00:38:05,086
That won't do at all.

855
00:38:05,110 --> 00:38:05,856
Why not?

856
00:38:05,880 --> 00:38:07,490
In Seizing Sect, we honor our teachers.

857
00:38:08,030 --> 00:38:09,030
Hanzhi?

858
00:38:11,440 --> 00:38:12,440
Hanzhi?

859
00:38:13,440 --> 00:38:15,340
Cansheng, keep an eye on her.

860
00:38:15,400 --> 00:38:16,690
Don't let her cause trouble.

861
00:38:21,590 --> 00:38:24,300
Yuan Ze greets the East Sea's Second Prince.

862
00:38:25,440 --> 00:38:26,440
Shh.

863
00:38:26,670 --> 00:38:27,670
Senior.

864
00:38:28,110 --> 00:38:29,210
You know who I am?

865
00:38:30,480 --> 00:38:32,936
I am the Three Realms Know-It-All.

866
00:38:32,960 --> 00:38:34,040
Of course I know you are...

867
00:38:34,510 --> 00:38:35,510
Shh.

868
00:38:37,550 --> 00:38:38,936
Shh.

869
00:38:38,960 --> 00:38:42,050
Thanks for keeping my secret.

870
00:38:42,630 --> 00:38:43,650
No problem.

871
00:38:44,190 --> 00:38:46,860
If you leave, that's one thing.

872
00:38:47,030 --> 00:38:48,646
But if you stay on Turtle Island,

873
00:38:48,670 --> 00:38:50,610
what am I supposed to do?

874
00:38:51,320 --> 00:38:53,376
When I left the Dragon Palace,

875
00:38:53,400 --> 00:38:55,126
I never knew dragons

876
00:38:55,150 --> 00:38:56,740
had committed such great crimes.

877
00:38:57,880 --> 00:38:59,340
I only hope that from today on,

878
00:38:59,960 --> 00:39:00,960
I can make it up to her.

879
00:39:01,760 --> 00:39:02,760
Make it up to who?

880
00:39:05,150 --> 00:39:06,570
No one.

881
00:39:09,070 --> 00:39:09,816
Well done, Junior.

882
00:39:09,840 --> 00:39:10,840
Senior.

883
00:39:20,360 --> 00:39:21,480
The flute from the East Sea?

884
00:40:06,760 --> 00:40:08,206
Dragon Calamity brought floods.

885
00:40:08,230 --> 00:40:09,416
The whole village was drowned.

886
00:40:09,440 --> 00:40:11,010
Only I survived.

887
00:40:11,400 --> 00:40:12,610
When I'm strong enough,

888
00:40:12,760 --> 00:40:14,980
I'll make the Dragon Clan pay in blood.

889
00:40:45,000 --> 00:40:46,940
Who's playing the East Sea Jade Flute?

890
00:40:53,760 --> 00:40:54,340
Right.

891
00:40:54,710 --> 00:40:55,710
Senior taught me

892
00:40:55,800 --> 00:40:57,130
to use my spiritual sense.

893
00:41:35,070 --> 00:41:36,650
No, no. Don't move.

894
00:41:37,070 --> 00:41:38,816
Who are you? Why lure me here?

895
00:41:38,840 --> 00:41:39,840
Guess.

896
00:41:41,030 --> 00:41:42,740
You can play the East Sea Jade Flute.

897
00:41:44,190 --> 00:41:45,740
Did Father send you

898
00:41:45,920 --> 00:41:47,050
to take me back?

899
00:41:47,230 --> 00:41:48,230
And if so?

900
00:41:48,360 --> 00:41:50,340
I said I won't go back.

901
00:41:50,480 --> 00:41:51,486
You don't get to decide.

902
00:41:51,510 --> 00:41:52,340
No, wait.

903
00:41:52,400 --> 00:41:53,606
I will prove dragons are wrong,

904
00:41:53,630 --> 00:41:54,750
and my brother is wrong too.

905
00:42:04,590 --> 00:42:05,606
I came to the Mortal Realm

906
00:42:05,630 --> 00:42:07,336
to learn human cultivation.

907
00:42:07,360 --> 00:42:09,650
Only then can I revive our clan.

908
00:42:10,920 --> 00:42:12,380
What did you learn here?

909
00:42:12,920 --> 00:42:14,050
Let me see.

910
00:42:17,320 --> 00:42:19,340
I'll show you.

911
00:42:30,360 --> 00:42:31,860
A sneak attack?

912
00:43:05,870 --> 00:43:11,650
♪ See mortal joys and sorrows ♪

913
00:43:12,320 --> 00:43:19,020
♪ Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds ♪

914
00:43:20,550 --> 00:43:26,600
♪ Alas, love has many twists and turns ♪

915
00:43:27,230 --> 00:43:33,680
♪ Memories filled with sorrow ♪

916
00:43:34,420 --> 00:43:41,540
♪ Slowly, wishes turn to regret ♪

917
00:43:41,920 --> 00:43:48,820
♪ You've gone afar, like mist fading ♪

918
00:43:49,200 --> 00:43:56,526
♪ Tearfully, this life's bond is not over ♪

919
00:43:56,550 --> 00:44:03,720
♪ Past fragments vanish into night ♪

920
00:44:19,860 --> 00:44:25,030
♪ Down a few more cups of wine ♪

921
00:44:26,120 --> 00:44:33,140
♪ Through land and sea, I ask you to come ♪

922
00:44:34,330 --> 00:44:40,270
♪ For honor's sake, upright and grand ♪

923
00:44:40,970 --> 00:44:48,050
♪ Alas, our story is short ♪

924
00:44:48,390 --> 00:44:55,500
♪ Slowly, wishes turn to regret ♪

925
00:44:55,820 --> 00:45:02,300
♪ You've gone afar, like mist fading ♪

926
00:45:03,080 --> 00:45:10,290
♪ Tearfully, this life's bond is not over ♪

927
00:45:10,680 --> 00:45:18,500
♪ Past fragments vanish into night ♪
